Error [E0363]: `T` can't be a union member
  --> tests/ui/union_generic_open.jet:2:27
    |
  2 | fn choose<T>(value: T) => Int | T :: ~value
    |                           ^^^^^^^
 Why: anonymous unions hold concrete closed types — not type parameters, trait objects, or function types
 Fix: use a named enum when a member needs an open shape
